{"title": "Retaliation", "pageid": 17299, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Retaliation", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Radiant.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp/300px-Generic_Radiant.webp, /w/images/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp/300px-Generic_Radiant.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Generic_Radiant.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Retaliation</b> is a passive feature that allows the creature being attacked to immediately strike back.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Strike back at the next enemy that attacks you. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Guardian_of_Faith_(creature)\" title=\"Guardian of Faith (creature)\">Guardian of Faith (creature)</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042349\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.025 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 451/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1393/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 779/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUn